# Project Structure & Architecture

## Recommended structure
- `lib/`
  - `app/` (app bootstrap, router, theme, DI composition)
  - `shared/` (shared UI, utils, primitives, cross-cutting helpers)
  - `features/<feature_name>/`
    - `presentation/`
    - `domain/`
    - `data/`
    - `<feature_name>.dart` (public API barrel file)

## Feature public API rule
- ✅ Other features import ONLY:
  - `package:app/features/foo/foo.dart`
- ✅ Internal feature folders should not be imported directly from outside

## Layer rules
- `presentation` can import `domain` (same feature) + `shared`
- `domain` imports nothing from `presentation` or `data`
- `data` can import `domain` (interfaces/entities) + `shared` (safe utilities)

## What goes where
- `domain/`: entities, value objects, usecases, repo interfaces, failures
- `data/`: API client, DTOs, local sources, repo impl, mappers
- `presentation/`: pages, widgets, controllers/notifiers, UI models

## NEVER
- ❌ Put HTTP/DB code in presentation
- ❌ Put Flutter imports (`material.dart`) inside domain
- ❌ Reference another feature’s internal folders directly
